= Waldeck-Pyrmont is annexed into Prussia

The small state of Waldeck-Pyrmont has been formally annexed into prussia. The Waldeck SPD has been integrated into the larger Prussian SPD, providing them will a small amount of resources.</br></br>
Seat Changes in Prusia: </br></br>
SPD seats : +3 </br>
Independents seats: +9 </br>
DNVP seats: +3 </br>
DVP seats: +1 </br>
DDP seats: +1 </br>
